WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.909
Watch and read: While at the market, Ama thinks about this: What makes a useful

00:00:04.909 --> 00:00:06.792
reading journal after finishing a book?

00:00:07.617 --> 00:00:13.043
The answer is: The title, a short summary and a personal response. A reading journal

00:00:13.043 --> 00:00:15.937
summarises what you read and records your response.

